This library uses C++26 static reflection (P2996). It must be built
with the reflection-toolchain sysroot:
https://github.com/daemonarium/reflection-toolchain

Reflection support comes from Bloomberg's clang-p2996 and its libcxx
(Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions), distributed via that
toolchain repo. This repository does not bundle that compiler.

Unit tests use boost-ext/ut, Boost Software License 1.0:
https://github.com/boost-ext/ut
